  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the fries between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a83c788ac3b59edd06095b/step-42c74f13.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• Grate carrot, then squeeze out any excess moisture using a paper towel.\n• Halve cherry tomatoes. Roughly chop coriander leaves. Slice lemon into wedges. Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons. TIP: Removing excess liquid from the carrot will help the fritters crisp up in the pan!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a83c788ac3b59edd06095b/step-a8e48e71.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine chickpeas, caramelised onion chutney, the egg and the milk. Mash with a potato masher or fork until the chickpeas are broken up.\n• Add carrot, coriander, the plain flour, fine breadcrumbs, Mumbai spice blend and a pinch of salt. Mix well to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a83c788ac3b59edd06095b/step-2d9fab15.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, add heaped tablespoons of patty mixture, in batches, flattening with a spatula. Cook until golden, 3-4 minutes each side (don't flip too early!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. TIP: Add extra olive oil between batches as needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a83c788ac3b59edd06095b/step-b88d31c7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the patties are cooking, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil in a medium bowl.\n• Season with salt and pepper, then add cucumber and cherry tomatoes. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a83c788ac3b59edd06095b/step-b462982c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Indian-spiced chickpea patties, fries and salad between plates.\n• Squeeze some lemon juice over patties.\n• Serve with a dollop of garlic sauce and any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a83c788ac3b59edd06095b/step-303602ed.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
